	Mike Mitchell  (duke!mcnc!ncsu!mcm)
	.SH ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS
	Mark and Karen Horton	(cbosgd!mark)
	.br
	John Carl Zeigler	(duke!mcnc!ncsu!jcz)
	.SH BUGS
	.I Mkpath assumes every site is connected via UUCP and exchanges mail.
